  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_hose_cb1365b3fbaedf1d5b9bc453c7a91b31acc5063847ec2182178172469c5ece86f42">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>meaning unknown | footwear, especially hose; knitted stocking | footwear, esp. hose; knitted stocking | footwear, esp. hose; knitted stocking, but clausa is of unknown meaning | hose, here short (Latham Word-List s.v. caliga) | hose; stocking (Latham Word-List s.v. caliga), here short | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, sometimes also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.) | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, sometimes also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.), here for women | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, here also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.) | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, sometimes also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.) (in pairs) | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, sometimes also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.), here knit | hose (q.v.), knit</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
